// Development-only authorization candidate; NOT deployed or included in emulator suite.
// This is a design reference, not a production-ready allow rule.
// Preconditions for any future client create:
// 1. Authenticated buyer distinct from provider; exact canonical room ID.
// 2. Exactly two participants [buyer, provider]; service metadata only.
// 3. Active provider profile with ownerUid matching provider.
// 4. Trusted, rules-readable mutual block checks (not yet available).
// 5. Full audit of legacy chats rules (overlapping allows are ORed).
// Until all conditions are implemented and tested, keep create denied.
match /chats/{chatId} {
  allow create: if false;
}
